@* One named area of a site's page (F117, ADR 0106): a section that must carry an id, a kicker over its content, and the
   classes a site adds for its look. The id is what the guide's ShowPage names and the section index links, so a page
   built of bands has every area named by construction. The band draws no style of its own: .band and .kicker are the
   site's, so each site keeps its look. *@
<section id="@Id" class="@Classes">
    @if (Kicker is not null)
    {
        <span class="kicker">@Kicker</span>
    }
    @ChildContent
</section>
